MyLake for your local (Delta) lakes

User documentation lives in the docs/ directory. Start with the index:
  docs/index.md  — full documentation index

Quick links to commonly used pages:
  docs/lake-paths.md        — opening a lake and recent-paths history
  docs/browsing.md          — navigating tables and choosing rows per page
  docs/filtering.md         — filtering rows by keyword
  docs/sorting.md           — sorting by any column
  docs/exporting.md         — exporting the current page to CSV
  docs/json-export.md       — exporting the current page to JSON
  docs/sql-editor.md        — inline SQL query editor
  docs/schema.md            — table schema inspector
  docs/column-stats.md      — per-column statistics panel
  docs/version-history.md   — Delta table version history viewer
  docs/table-properties.md  — table properties modal
  docs/dark-mode.md         — dark mode toggle
  docs/language.md          — switching the display language (EN / Chinese)
  docs/keyboard-shortcuts.md — keyboard shortcuts
  docs/shareable-url.md     — shareable URLs for the current view
